  m_text: "Instructions:\r\n\r\nPress ESC to immediately stop stimulation.\r\nPress
    UP ARROW to increase stimulation intensity.\r\nPress DOWN ARROW to decrease stimulation
    intensity.\r\nPress LEFT ARROW to change channels.\nPress SPACEBAR to test your
    current stimulation intensity.\r\n\nCurrent channel is marked by the green bar\nWaveform
    upload will upload the currently selected waveform to the current channel\n\r\nStimulation
    will only be provided while pressing the arrows or the Spacebar. \r\n"
